5. Reply to the user in one or two short Chinese sentences: each round's progress plus any anomaly. When nothing is wrong, say "正常运行中" plus progress. When something is stalled or broken, say what and recommend what to do (do not kill a process yourself). Once every codex run has exited, say so and delete this watchdog job yourself with CronDelete.
